I would check these next

Check the node status

oc get nodes

Check the current MachineConfig state

oc describe node <node-name> | grep -A10 MachineConfig

Check why CRI-O is failing

journalctl -u crio -b -n 100

or

systemctl status crio -l


---

If you actually want MCO to apply changes

Unpause the MCP:

oc patch mcp master --type=merge -p '{"spec":{"paused":false}}'

Then watch:

oc get mcp master -w


